{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le05ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le05ob05re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn8le05ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn8le05ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tJose, one of our waiters just called. He's not going to be able to make it in tonight. I'd like you to fill in for him. Do you feel up to it?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tSure! How can I not feel ready after all the pointers you've given me?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tI'm glad you see it that way. You're going to wait on the theater crowd tonight. That will not be disappointing!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tWhy do you say that?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tThey're a trendy bunch, you'll see. They're not your usual customers. They're extremely fashion-conscious.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn8le05ob05re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tI'm not sure I understand ... <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tThey love to dress up. It is not common to see anyone wearing casual clothes on Friday or Saturday night here. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tOh! So they are dressed to the nines!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tThat's a great expression. You're learning fast!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tThank you. I'm trying to keep up with my English lessons.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tWell, according to everyone, you're doing just fine. I think you can get by with what you know at this point.", "id": 2, "time": "27000"}, {"image": "engenn8le05ob05re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tI hope so. Do you have any last minute advice on what I should do tonight?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tI can tell you what not to do. People who drop in after a play or a show don't like to feel rushed to finish their dinner or drinks. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tAlright. I will try not to get on their nerves!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tYou'll be fine! I'm sure they'll love your accent!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tLet's hope they tip well, too.", "id": 3, "time": "53000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about manners and customs. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about life experiences. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can explain my opinion. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " When do you like to dress up? For what occasions do you usually dress up?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you think it's important to dress up to go to a restaurant? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Tonight's the night! Now is not the time to be stressed about it!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Jose starts tonight! This is not a <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">drill</span>!", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "g